WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.800
The owner sends champagne for
Christmas pre-sales,

2
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.160
40 euros a bottle,

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.020
and asks Rosalia to put it on Google
and Instagram to take pre-orders.

4
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.960
She posts it on the Google profile.

5
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:21.440
Then on Instagram, likes come in;
she replies under the post.

6
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:30.130
A customer asks for a box of six,
Rosalia sends the payment link.

7
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.830
The owner gets it on WhatsApp.
Six bottles.

8
00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.410
The details are in Stripe.
